nce 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 15% of normal in January to February and 165% in March to April. So far in 2026, May to June stands at 55% on the middle of the grids. Grid 15118 has a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 16.6, and its driest year was 2011 at 40%.</p>"}
